ngtcp2-crypto-rustls (1.16.0-1~smallgearlab3) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Follows the QUIC API of librustls-quic 0.15.7+quic3 (rustls_quic_connection_
    get_secret, get_alert, get_negotiated_ciphersuite, get_peer_certificate,
    get_peer_transport_parameters). Build-Depends and the dependency of the
    library name that version; librustls-quic Breaks the helper before this one.
    The functions of this library are the same.

